---
layout: layouts/standalone.njk
title: Билгийн тоолол · Lunar calendar
description: Subscribable Mongol, Tibetan and Bhutanese lunar calendars for Apple, Google and Outlook calendar apps.
language: mn
permalink: /cal/
langnames:
  mn: { mn: Монгол, en: Mongolian }
  en: { mn: Англи, en: English }
  bo: { mn: བོད་ཡིག, en: བོད་ཡིག }
  dz: { mn: རྫོང་ཁ, en: རྫོང་ཁ }
days:
  d115: { mn: Шинийн 1 ба 15, en: 1st and 15th }
  d1: { mn: Зөвхөн шинийн 1, en: 1st only }
  ausp: { mn: Балжка Дашка, en: Auspicious days }
  d115_tib: { mn: ཚེས་༡ དང་༡༥, en: ཚེས་༡ དང་༡༥ }
  d1_tib: { mn: ཚེས་༡ ཁོ་ན།, en: ཚེས་༡ ཁོ་ན། }
feeds:
  - name: { mn: Монгол билгийн тоолол, en: Mongol lunar calendar }
    festivals:
      mn: "Баяр ёслол: Битүүн, Цагаан сар, Их дүйчин, Чингис хааны төрсөн өдөр. Балжка Дашка: уламжлалт зурхайн бичигт заасан Балжинням, Дашням, Модон хохимой, Тэрсүүд. Энэ нь үндсэн хуанлийн нэмэлт тул хамт захиалахад юу ч давхардахгүй."
      en: "Festivals: Bituun, Tsagaan Sar, Ikh Düichen, Chinggis Khaan's birthday. Auspicious days: Baljinnyam, Dashnyam, Modon khokhimoi and Tersüüd, as given in the traditional Mongolian almanac. It is an add-on to the calendar above: subscribe to both and nothing appears twice."
    tip:
      mn: "Ихэнх хүмүүс эхний болон 3 дахь мөрт буй календарийг сонгоод нэмэхэд болно."
      en: "Most people only need the calendars in the first and third rows (in English: the fourth and sixth)."
    rows:
      - [mongol-mn.ics, mn, d115]
      - [mongol-mn-no15.ics, mn, d1]
      - [mongol-auspicious-mn.ics, mn, ausp]
      - [mongol-en.ics, en, d115]
      - [mongol-en-no15.ics, en, d1]
      - [mongol-auspicious-en.ics, en, ausp]
  - name: { mn: Төвд зурхай (Пүг), en: Tibetan calendar (Phugpa) }
    native: བོད་ཀྱི་ལོ་ཐོ། (ཕུག་ལུགས།)
    festivals: &tibfest
      mn: "Баяр ёслол: Лосар ба дөрвөн их дүйчин."
      en: "Festivals: Losar and the four düchen."
    rows:
      - [phugpa-bo.ics, bo, d115_tib]
      - [phugpa-bo-no15.ics, bo, d1_tib]
      - [phugpa-en.ics, en, d115]
      - [phugpa-en-no15.ics, en, d1]
  - name: { mn: Төвд зурхай (Цүр), en: Tibetan calendar (Tsurphu) }
    native: བོད་ཀྱི་ལོ་ཐོ། (མཚུར་ལུགས།)
    festivals: *tibfest
    rows:
      - [tsurphu-bo.ics, bo, d115_tib]
      - [tsurphu-bo-no15.ics, bo, d1_tib]
      - [tsurphu-en.ics, en, d115]
      - [tsurphu-en-no15.ics, en, d1]
  - name: { mn: Бутан зурхай, en: Bhutanese calendar }
    native: འབྲུག་གི་ལོ་ཐོ།
    festivals: *tibfest
    rows:
      - [bhutan-dz.ics, dz, d115_tib]
      - [bhutan-dz-no15.ics, dz, d1_tib]
      - [bhutan-en.ics, en, d115]
      - [bhutan-en-no15.ics, en, d1]
---
{% macro t(o) %}<span class="l-mn">{{ o.mn }}</span><span class="l-en">{{ o.en }}</span>{% endmacro %}
<script>
  (function () {
    var lang = "mn";
    try {
      var q = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get("lang");
      lang = q || localStorage.getItem("cal-lang") || "mn";
    } catch (e) {}
    if (lang === "en") {
      document.documentElement.classList.add("ui-en");
      document.documentElement.lang = "en";
    }
  })();
</script>
<style>
  html:not(.ui-en) .l-en,
  html.ui-en .l-mn { display: none !important; }
  .cal-head h1 { max-width: none; }
  .cal-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
  .lang-switch { font-size: 0.95rem; white-space: nowrap; padding-top: 0.6rem; }
  .lang-switch a { text-decoration: none; }
  .feed-links a {
    display: inline-block; margin: 0.15rem 0.35rem 0.15rem 0; padding: 0.12rem 0.7rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--panel-2);
    color: var(--link); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .btn-pair { white-space: nowrap; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .data-table th, .data-table td { padding-left: 0.2rem; padding-right: 0.2rem; }
    .feed-links a { padding: 0.1rem 0.55rem; margin-right: 0.25rem; }
  }
  .feed-links a:hover, .feed-links a:focus-visible { border-color: var(--link); background: #fff; }
  .feed-copy.copied { border-color: var(--accent-2); color: var(--accent-2); }
  .feed-copy .copy-msg, .feed-copy.copied .copy-label { display: none; }
  .feed-copy.copied .copy-msg { display: inline; }
  .feed-url { display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .cal-note { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--muted, #555); }
  .data-table + .cal-note { margin-top: 0.9rem; }
  .cal-footer { text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted, #555); margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line, #ddd); }
  .cal-footer a { font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; }
  .cal-native { font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 0.5rem; color: var(--muted, #555); }
  html:not(.ui-en) .lang-switch [data-set="mn"],
  html.ui-en .lang-switch [data-set="en"] { font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; }
</style>

<div class="cal-head">
  <h1><span class="l-mn">Билгийн тоолол</span><span class="l-en">Lunar calendar</span></h1>
  <nav class="lang-switch" aria-label="Language">
    <a href="?lang=mn" data-set="mn">MN</a> | <a href="?lang=en" data-set="en">EN</a>
  </nav>
</div>

<p class="lede narrow l-mn">Сар бүрийн шинийн 1 ба 15, мөн билгийн тооллыг дагадаг гол баяр ёслолуудыг календарьтаа нэмээрэй. Огноог 2050 он хүртэл тооцоолсон.</p>
<p class="lede narrow l-en">Add lunar days 1 and 15 of every month, and the main festivals that follow the lunar calendar, to your calendar. The dates are computed up to 2050.</p>

<div class="stack">
  {% for cal in feeds %}
    <section class="rule-section">
      <h2>{{ t(cal.name) }}{% if cal.native %} <span class="cal-native">{{ cal.native }}</span>{% endif %}</h2>
      {% if loop.first %}
      <p class="cal-note l-mn">iPhone, iPad, Mac дээр <em>Apple</em> товчийг дарна. Google хуанли, Android дээр компьютерээсээ <em>Google</em> товчийг дарна. Outlook болон бусад програмд <em>Холбоос хуулах</em> дарж, "Subscribe from web" хэсэгт paste хийнэ.</p>
      <p class="cal-note l-en">On iPhone, iPad or Mac, press <em>Apple</em>. For Google Calendar and Android, press <em>Google</em> on a computer. For Outlook and other apps, press <em>Copy link</em> and paste it into "Subscribe from web".</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if cal.tip %}<p class="cal-note">{{ t(cal.tip) }}</p>{% endif %}
      <table class="data-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th><span class="l-mn">Хэл</span><span class="l-en">Language</span></th>
            <th><span class="l-mn">Харуулах өдрүүд</span><span class="l-en">Days shown</span></th>
            <th><span class="l-mn">Захиалах</span><span class="l-en">Subscribe</span></th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for row in cal.rows %}
            <tr>
              <td>{{ t(langnames[row[1]]) }}</td>
              <td>{{ t(days[row[2]]) }}</td>
              <td class="feed-links" data-feed="{{ row[0] }}">
                <span class="btn-pair"><a class="feed-apple" href="{{ row[0] }}">Apple</a><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?cid=webcal://gantemur.github.io/cal/{{ row[0] }}">Google</a></span>
                <a class="feed-copy" href="{{ row[0] }}"><span class="copy-label"><span class="l-mn">Холбоос хуулах</span><span class="l-en">Copy link</span></span><span class="copy-msg"><span class="l-mn">✓ Хуулагдлаа</span><span class="l-en">✓ Copied</span></span></a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="cal-note">{{ t(cal.festivals) }}</p>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}

  <section class="rule-section l-mn">
    <h2>Хэрхэн нэмэх вэ</h2>
    <ul class="compact-list">
      <li><strong>iPhone, iPad, Mac:</strong> <em>Apple</em> дээр дарж захиалгаа баталгаажуулна.</li>
      <li><strong>Google хуанли:</strong> компьютер дээрээ <em>Google</em> дээр дарж баталгаажуулна. Дараа нь Android болон iPhone дээрх Google Calendar аппд мөн гарч ирнэ (харагдахгүй бол аппын тохиргооноос асаагаарай).</li>
      <li><strong>Outlook болон бусад:</strong> <em>Холбоос хуулах</em> дээр дарж, хуулсан хаягаа "Subscribe from web" эсвэл "Add calendar from URL" хэсэгт paste хийнэ.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="cal-note">Тоолол маань 2050 он хүртэл тооцоологдсон учраас нэг нэмчихсэн бол сүлжээгүй газар ч санаа амар байж болно. Ямар нэг шинэчлэл хийгдлээ гэхэд захиалсан хуанли түүнийг нь автоматаар тусгана.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="rule-section l-en">
    <h2>How to add</h2>
    <ul class="compact-list">
      <li><strong>iPhone, iPad, Mac:</strong> tap or click <em>Apple</em> and confirm the subscription.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Calendar:</strong> click <em>Google</em> on a computer and confirm. The calendar then also appears in the Google Calendar app on Android and iPhone (enable it under the app's settings if hidden).</li>
      <li><strong>Outlook and other apps:</strong> click <em>Copy link</em> and paste the address into "Subscribe from web" or "Add calendar from URL".</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="cal-note">The calendar is computed up to 2050, so once added it keeps working without a connection. If anything is updated, a subscribed calendar picks it up automatically.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="rule-section l-mn">
    <h2>Дүрэм</h2>
    <ul class="compact-list">
      <li>Шинийн 1 тасарвал сарын эхийг шинийн 2-нд тэмдэглэнэ. Шинийн 1 давтагдвал хоёр өдөр хоёул тэмдэглэгдэнэ.</li>
      <li>Шинийн 15 тасарвал шинийн 14-нийг, давтагдвал хоёр өдрийг хоёуланг харуулна. Тогтмол шинийн өдөрт тохиодог баярууд мөн энэ дүрмийг баримтална. Баярууд илүү сард биш, жирийн сард тохионо.</li>
      <li>Балжка Дашка өдрүүдийг Монгол зурхайн түгээмэл заншлаар тэмдэглэнэ: тасарсан шинийн өдөрт тохиовол өмнөх өдөрт нь; давхар өдрийн зөвхөн хоёр дахид нь; илүү сартай хосоос зөвхөн илүү (эхний) сард нь.</li>
      <li>Бүх тэмдэглэл бүтэн өдрийнх бөгөөд "чөлөөтэй" гэж тэмдэглэгдсэн тул таны цагийн хуваарийг хаахгүй.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="rule-section l-en">
    <h2>Conventions</h2>
    <ul class="compact-list">
      <li>If lunar day 1 is omitted, the start of the month is marked on lunar day 2. If lunar day 1 is repeated, both days are marked.</li>
      <li>If lunar day 15 is omitted, lunar day 14 is shown; if it is repeated, both days are shown. Festivals on a fixed lunar day follow the same rule. Festivals fall in the regular, not the leap, month.</li>
      <li>Auspicious days follow the usual Mongolian almanac handling: a day falling on an omitted lunar day is shown on the day before; of a repeated lunar day only the second is marked; in a leap-month pair only the leap (first) month carries them.</li>
      <li>Events are all-day and marked as free time, so they do not block your schedule.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>

<footer class="cal-footer">
  Powered by <a href="https://gantemur.github.io/caltib/">caltib</a> — Designed by Tsogtgerel Gantumur &middot; &copy; 2026
</footer>

<script>
  for (const a of document.querySelectorAll(".feed-apple")) {
    a.href = "webcal://gantemur.github.io/cal/" + a.closest("[data-feed]").dataset.feed;
  }
  for (const a of document.querySelectorAll(".feed-copy")) {
    a.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      const url = "https://gantemur.github.io/cal/" + a.closest("[data-feed]").dataset.feed;
      const done = function () {
        a.classList.add("copied");
        setTimeout(function () { a.classList.remove("copied"); }, 2000);
      };
      const fallback = function () {
        // Show the address so it can be copied by hand.
        let box = a.parentNode.querySelector(".feed-url");
        if (!box) {
          box = document.createElement("input");
          box.className = "feed-url";
          box.readOnly = true;
          box.value = url;
          a.parentNode.appendChild(box);
        }
        box.focus();
        box.select();
      };
      try {
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(url).then(done, fallback);
      } catch (err) {
        fallback();
      }
    });
  }
  for (const a of document.querySelectorAll(".lang-switch a")) {
    a.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      const en = a.dataset.set === "en";
      document.documentElement.classList.toggle("ui-en", en);
      document.documentElement.lang = en ? "en" : "mn";
      try { localStorage.setItem("cal-lang", a.dataset.set); } catch (err) {}
      try { history.replaceState(null, "", en ? "?lang=en" : location.pathname); } catch (err) {}
    });
  }
</script>
